<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52986" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάμμᾰρος</span></b> , ὁ, a kind
		of <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lobster</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epich.
				60
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sophr.
				26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Rhinth.
				18
			</span></i>:— also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καμμαρίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.735
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a kind of
				<i>aconite</i>, used as a cooling medicine, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Loc.Hom.</u>
				27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Stratt.
				21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.76
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				41
			</span></i>; also, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δελφίνιον</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.73
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μανδραγόρα ἄρρεν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.75
			</span></i>. (Meaning and spelling are dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Erot.
			</span></i> s.v.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάμαρος</span></b>  and
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάμμορον</span></b>  were variants,
			the latter is v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
			</span></i> l.c., cf. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
			</span></i> l.c.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
